| description = In the mines and near the bank in South Kaladim can be found the rogues of Miners Guild 628.  These rogues get along fine with the Halfling Roges of Deeppoockets 
in [[Rivervale]] but oppose the rogues of the [[Circle of Unseen Hands]] in [[Qeynos]] and the Dark Elf Rogues of the [[Ebon Mask]] in Neriak.  They also hate the [[Butcherblock Bandits]].  
[[Mater]] is the guildmaster here and his stance against the more evil rogue guilds make his guild quite tolerated by the forces of good in the land.

