= Suggested Route =
*Kill named bandits ([[Barma Dunfire]], [[Peg Leg]], etc) in [[Butcherblock Mountains]] at spot 10 and 12.  (-[[Butcherblock Bandits]], +[[Miners Guild 628]], +[[Storm Guard]]).<br>You can save the tongues from the Dunfire's for [[Parrying Pick Quest]] (+[[Miners Guild 628]], -[[Circle Of Unseen Hands]], -[[Butcherblock Bandits]], +[[DeepPockets]], -[[Hall of the Ebon Mask]]), if you want to go to [[Crushbone]] for the [[Rondo's Tongue]] and willing to accept/fix the negative faction.
*[[The Gnome Take]] (lowers clockworks which cannot be raised) (+[[Miners Guild 628]], +[[Deeppockets]], -[[Circle of Unseen Hands]], -[[Butcherblock Bandits]], -[[Ebon Mask]], -[[Clockworks of Ak`Anon]])

